    "body": "These bullet points could maybe be merged, if I understand the intent correctly:\n\n> * Additionally, when [navigation](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsing-the-web.html#navigate) is initiated by a user (that is, where the [user navigation involvement](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsing-the-web.html#user-navigation-involvement) is \"browser UI\"), the Attribution API is available for a short period.\n\n> * Any [navigation](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsing-the-web.html#navigate) of the [top-level traversable](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#nav-top) to a different [site](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#site) disables the API. However, any [activation](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#activation-triggering-input-event), which might include the action that initiated the navigation, could make the API available again.\n\ni.e. check that the navigation is not a cross-site top-level navigation before making the API available.",
