    "updated_at": "2026-05-19T02:28:02Z",
    "body": "The first establishes one of the two conditions for activation: a click or user-initiated navigation.  I'm trying to avoid a state machine diagram, but it should be something like:\n\nnull --a--> available --b--> enabled --c--> null\n\nWhere -a- is a click or navigation, -b- is using the API (within the time limit), and -c- is cross-site navigation.\n\nI've taken another go at explaining this with those three states as the three bullets.  Is that clearer?",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
